WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.620
Edward Curtis arrives in the 1890s
and pulls together every visual habit

2
00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:07.390
Americans had been absorbing
for generations.

3
00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:10.190
He stages scenes using older clothing.

4
00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:14.630
And then he titles his most famous image
The Vanishing Race.

5
00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:17.870
This is the moment
when the pattern becomes unmistakable.
